graph TB
    %% Top-to-bottom layout is used for full-screen readability in draw.io
    Team[Project / Migration Team]

    subgraph Governance["Trust Boundary: Governance & Request Layer"]
        direction LR
        SN[ServiceNow\nCatalog + CMDB]
        IH[IntegrationHub]
    end

    subgraph Pipeline["Trust Boundary: CI/CD Orchestration Layer"]
        direction TB
        GH[GitHub\nRepository]
        GHA[GitHub Actions]
        IMG[Ansible Image Build\nPlaybooks]
        ANS[Ansible]
        SGATE{Security and Quality Gates Passed?}
    end

    subgraph Security["Trust Boundary: Security & Quality Gates"]
        direction LR
        SAST[Code Security Scans\nSAST + Dependency + Secret]
        IAC[IaC Policy Scans\ntfsec + Checkov]
        AMISCAN[Artifact Security Scans\nECR + Inspector]
        IGATE{Image Scan Passed?}
        RUNTIMESEC[Runtime Security Posture\nSecurity Hub + GuardDuty + IAM Access Analyzer]
    end

    subgraph AWS["Trust Boundary: AWS Control Plane"]
        direction LR
        OIDC[AWS IAM OIDC\nProvider]
        SSMSESS[AWS SSM Session Manager]
        PARAM[AWS SSM Parameter Store]
        INV[AWS SSM Inventory]
        AMI[Golden AMI Registry]
    end

    subgraph Runtime["Trust Boundary: AWS Runtime / Build Targets"]
        direction LR
        EC2[Private Builder EC2]
        APP[Target Workloads\nWebLogic / Tomcat / Python]
    end

    Team -->|Submit service request| SN
    SN -->|Trigger workflow event| IH
    IH -->|Dispatch pipeline run| GHA
    SN -. CMDB metadata / change context .-> GHA
    SN -->|Failed scan remediation request| Team

    GH -->|Push/PR pipeline trigger| GHA
    GHA -->|Request federated identity token| OIDC
    OIDC -->|Return temporary AWS credentials| GHA

    GHA -->|Run application security scans| SAST
    GHA -->|Run IaC policy validation| IAC
    SAST -->|Gate evidence| SGATE
    IAC -->|Gate evidence| SGATE
    SGATE -->|Passed, proceed with image build| IMG
    SGATE -->|Failed, remediation required (tracked in ServiceNow)| SN

    IMG -->|Run playbook execution| EC2
    SSMSESS -->|Open secure management session| EC2

    GHA -->|Start SSM automation/session| SSMSESS
    GHA -->|Launch configuration tasks| ANS
    ANS -->|Configure builder host| EC2
    PARAM -->|Provide approved build parameters| EC2

    EC2 -->|Publish hardened image| AMI
    AMI -->|Submit candidate image for scan| AMISCAN
    AMISCAN -->|Scan evidence| IGATE
    IGATE -->|Passed, deploy to workloads| APP
    IGATE -->|Failed, remediation required (tracked in ServiceNow)| SN
    APP -->|Runtime findings and posture telemetry| RUNTIMESEC
    RUNTIMESEC -->|Security posture feedback| SN

    EC2 -->|Send inventory state| INV
    INV -->|Sync inventory to CMDB| SN

    %% actor
    style Team fill:#E1F5FE,stroke:#01579B,stroke-width:2px,color:#000
